#, 4
msgid ""
"This is Big Boss...\n"
"Operation Intrude N313.\n"
"Infiltrate the enemy's base Outer Heaven and destroy the ultimate weapon, Metal Gear!\n"
"\n"
"Let's go over the details first. Make contact with Gray Fox, and find the location of the ultimate weapon, Metal Gear.\n"
"\n"
"Let's use frequency 120.85 for all communications from now on.\n"
"...Over."
msgstr ""

#, 4
msgid ""
"This is Big Boss...\n"
"The mission is infiltration. Make sure that the enemy does not discover your whereabouts. \n"
"...Over."
msgstr ""

#, 4
msgid ""
"This is Big Boss...\n"
"Outfit yourselves with weapons and equipment from the enemy's trucks and armory! Pick up ammunition on the way!\n"
"\n"
"You need a card to open the door. Look for the card.\n"
"...Over."
msgstr ""

#, 4
msgid ""
"This is Big Boss...\n"
"Use the elevator to move from floor to floor. Remember where the elevators are. \n"
"...Over."
msgstr ""

#, 4
msgid ""
"This is Big Boss...\n"
"Watch out for the surveillance cameras.\n"
"...Over."
msgstr ""

#, 4
msgid ""
"This is Big Boss...\n"
"The Resistance should be there. Try and contact them over the radio.\n"
"...Over."
msgstr ""

#, 4
msgid ""
"This is Big Boss...\n"
"I forgot to tell you. You'll need a gas mask for the gas room.\n"
"\n"
"Schneider, the leader of the Resistance, should be able to tell you where to get a gas mask.\n"
"...Over."
msgstr ""

#, 4
msgid ""
"This is Big Boss...\n"
"I forgot to tell you. In order to turn off the juice, you'll have to destroy the electrical power panel.\n"
"\n"
"You need an RC missile. Schneider, the leader of the Resistance, should be able to tell you where to get one.\n"
"...Over."
msgstr ""

#, 4
msgid ""
"This is Big Boss...\n"
"You will need to use camouflage in exposed locations. For example, maybe there's something you can wear on your\n"
"\n"
"head...\n"
"...Over."
msgstr ""

#, 4
msgid ""
"This is Big Boss...\n"
"Infiltration accomplished. Find the cell where they're holding Gray Fox.\n"
"\n"
"Check the walls!!\n"
"...Over."
msgstr ""

#, 4
msgid ""
"This is Big Boss...\n"
"Recover your weapons and equipment and get out of there!\n"
"\n"
"They've got to be hidden in a room somewhere. Punch your way through!\n"
"...Over."
msgstr ""

#, 4
msgid ""
"This is Big Boss...\n"
"I forgot to tell you. Watch out for the infrared sensors. You'll need infrared goggles.\n"
"...Over."
msgstr ""

#, 4
msgid ""
"This is Big Boss...\n"
"I forgot to tell you. There's a wind barrier on the roof. Look for a bomb blast suit! \n"
"...Over."
msgstr ""

#, 4
msgid ""
"This is Big Boss...\n"
"Inspections.\n"
"Wear the enemy uniform and infiltrate!\n"
"\n"
"Let's use frequency 120.13 for all communications from now on.\n"
"...Over."
msgstr ""

#, 4
msgid ""
"This is Big Boss...\n"
"They are trying to jam our signal, but we are OK on this frequency.\n"
"...Over."
msgstr ""

#, 4
msgid ""
"This is Big Boss...\n"
"Get in the truck on the right!\n"
"...Over."
msgstr ""

#, 4
msgid ""
"This is Big Boss...\n"
"Enter the door on your left.\n"
"...Over."
msgstr ""

#, 4
msgid ""
"This is Big Boss...\n"
"Solid Snake! \n"
"Abort the mission. Return immediately.\n"
"\n"
"This is an order!! Turn off the power on your Xbox 360 console at once!!\n"
"...Over."
msgstr ""

#, 4
msgid ""
"This is Big Boss...\n"
"Inspect your equipment!!\n"
"\n"
"Have you been bugged by the enemy?\n"
"...Over."
msgstr ""

#, 0
msgid "-"
msgstr ""
